summary:
Transition from complex escrow to an Inspect-First Pay-on-Delivery (POD) model:
1. Upfront delivery commitment fee checkout to protect sellers from ghosting;
2. Item-level unique tracking codes and vendor-level order grouping;
3. Post-delivery inspection workflow with dual payment triggers (Pay Vendor Total or Pay Individual Item);
4. In-app Paystack payment directly crediting the vendor's bank account with live seller confirmation;
5. Elimination of escrow release OTPs, lockouts, and bypass vulnerabilities.
